。なお、当社は、継続的な成長の実現に向けた準備として、連結子会社の清算および保有資産の減損等による特別損失を計上する見込みであります。これにより、親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益につきましては、2025年10月15日に公表した2026年５月期の通期連結業績予想から据置きとなります。　したがって、2026年5月期第３四半期連結累計期間および第４四半期の業績動向等を踏まえ、2026年5月期の通期業績予想につきましては上記のとおり修正いたします。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2025年7月14日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_FirstQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 6, "6.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ThirdQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 6, "6.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 12, "12.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_FirstQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 6, "6.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ThirdQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 7, "7.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_Fo